MID_MV11_06: <SH>
MID_MV11_06_m001: (excited crowd noises)
MID_MV11_06_m002: Wow! That's the delegation from Saramis!
MID_MV11_06_m003: Make way for the queen of Saramis!
MID_MV11_06_m004: (*crowd noise*)
MID_MV11_06_m005: They're the children of Damascar, aren't they?
MID_MV11_06_m006: They really went all out for this!
MID_MV11_06_m007: Is that Queen Theodora?
MID_MV11_06_m008: She's just...stunning.
MID_MV11_06_m009: They say Queen Theodora is so strong,\nshe can lift an elephant with one hand.
MID_MV11_06_m010: So that's Dagda's temple, is it?
MID_MV11_06_m011: That high perch is like a mark of\ndominion over the entire city.
MID_MV11_06_m012: Baw haw haw! That's why they\ncall it the City of the Gods!
MID_MV11_06_m013: Look at all these folks! So excited, getting\nlike their damn teeth are gonna fall out!
MID_MV11_06_m014: Reel it in, Tobias. We must\nshow them our dignity here.
MID_MV11_06_m015: (closed-lipped "hmph" exert)
MID_MV11_06_m016: We got the best view in the whole city!
MID_MV11_06_m017: Whoa...now that's a parade!
MID_MV11_06_m018: Oooh...
MID_MV11_06_m019: Amazing!
MID_MV11_06_m020: I've always read about parades, but this...\nThis is even grander than I thought it'd be.
MID_MV11_06_m021: Ah!
MID_MV11_06_m022: Tialla!
MID_MV11_06_m023: Oh!
MID_MV11_06_m024: Oh!
MID_MV11_06_m025: Ng! Ugh...
MID_MV11_06_m026: Oof!
MID_MV11_06_m027: Hm?
MID_MV11_06_m028: (*crowd noise*)
MID_MV11_06_m029: Hey! What're you doing?!
MID_MV11_06_m030: Oh no, don't! Please!
MID_MV11_06_m032: A problem up ahead.
MID_MV11_06_m033: Tsk. A child.
MID_MV11_06_m034: Hup!
MID_MV11_06_m035: C'mon, boss, we don't need to—
MID_MV11_06_m036: Hmph.
MID_MV11_06_m037: Gah!
MID_MV11_06_m038: Stop! Please!
MID_MV11_06_m039: (*crowd noise*)
MID_MV11_06_m040: Those who block the royal procession...
MID_MV11_06_m041: shall be put to death!
MID_MV11_06_m042: (short, surprised exert)
MID_MV11_06_m043: Waa!
MID_MV11_06_m044: Uhh...
MID_MV11_06_m045: (punching exert)
MID_MV11_06_m046: (crowd murmurs)
MID_MV11_06_m047: Ugh... Uugh...
MID_MV11_06_m048: What's this?